📉 Stock Prices Analysis
A time-series analysis project exploring historical stock data to identify trends, patterns, and basic forecasting possibilities.
The focus is on understanding market behavior through visual exploration and engineered time-based features.

📌 Features

Data cleaning and preprocessing

Time-series trend and pattern exploration

Visualizations of historical price movements

Feature engineering for temporal insights

Simple forecasting experiments and model evaluation

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Matplotlib · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Stock Prices.ipynb — complete analysis, visualizations, and modeling workflow
